---
import { getTravelSeries } from "../utils/travel-series";
const travelSeries = await getTravelSeries();
import { apiBase } from "../utils/services";
import { url } from "../utils/url-utils";
import "../styles/article-media.css";
import "../styles/comments.css";
import "../styles/admin.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" /><title>嘴哥 · 记录管理</title><link rel="icon" href={url("/favicon-graffiti.png")} /></head>
<body data-editor-api={apiBase}>
  <header><a href={url("/")} data-no-swup>← 回到博客</a><strong>嘴哥 · 记录管理</strong><button id="logout" hidden>退出管理</button></header>
  <main id="swup-container">
    <section id="login-panel" class="panel login-panel">
      <img class="studio-avatar" src={url("/avatar.webp")} alt="嘴哥的头像" width="64" height="64" />
      <p class="eyebrow">嘴哥的写作间</p><h1>把今天，慢慢写下来。</h1>
      <p class="muted">旅途的风景，生活的小事，还有学习中的一点收获。</p>
      <form id="login-form"><label for="login-password">管理密码<input id="login-password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="256" placeholder="输入密码，开始记录" /></label><button id="login-submit" type="submit" class="primary">进入写作间 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form>
      <p class="muted small">登录状态在此浏览器保留 7 天。共用设备请在完成后退出。</p>
      <p id="login-status" role="status" class="status"></p>
    </section>
    <div id="editor-panel" hidden>
      <div class="studio-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">生活 · 旅行 · 思考</p><h1>今天，想记下什么？</h1></div><p class="muted">让平常的日子，留下自己的注脚。</p></div>
      <nav class="editor-tabs"><button data-mode="post" class="active">日记与碎片</button><button data-mode="album">相册</button><button data-mode="friends">友链</button><button data-mode="comments">留言</button><span id="storage-status" class="muted"></span></nav>
      <details class="panel local-drafts"><summary id="local-draft-count">本机未提交的记录</summary><p class="muted small">只保存文字、设置和图片链接，不复制原图，不占网站存储。仅限当前浏览器；清除浏览器数据会丢失暂存，不会同步到其他设备。</p><div id="local-draft-list"></div></details>
      <div id="record-layout" class="record-layout">
        <aside class="panel records"><p class="eyebrow">我的记录</p><button id="new-record" class="primary">＋ 新建记录</button><div id="record-list"></div></aside>
        <section class="panel record-editor">
          <form id="record-form">
            <div class="row post-only"><label>类型<select id="category"><option>生活碎片</option><option>旅行日记</option><option value="">无</option></select></label><label class="checkbox"><input id="featured" type="checkbox" />设为精选</label></div>
            <label><span id="title-label">标题</span><input id="record-title" maxlength="160" placeholder="给这次记录起个名字" required /></label>
            <div class="row"><label>日期<input id="record-date" type="date" required /></label><label class="post-only">标签<input id="tags" placeholder="旅行、杭州、日常…" /></label></div>
            <label><span id="description-label">简短介绍</span><textarea id="description" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="用一句话介绍这次记录（可选）"></textarea></label>
            <fieldset class="series-fields"><legend>旅行系列（可选）</legend><label>系列名称<input id="series" maxlength="80" list="travel-series-options" placeholder="例如：2026 国庆之旅" /><datalist id="travel-series-options">{travelSeries.map(series => <option value={series.name} />)}</datalist></label><p class="muted small">同一趟旅行的日记和相册填写相同名称，就会自动归到一起；留空则不加入系列。</p><div class="row"><label>旅行日期<input id="tripDate" type="date" /></label><label>地点<input id="location" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：杭州 · 西湖" /></label><label>系列顺序<input id="seriesOrder" type="number" min="1" max="9999" step="1" placeholder="可选，如 1、2、3" /></label></div><p class="muted small">填写顺序的记录优先按数字排列，其余按旅行日期排列；旅行日期留空时使用记录日期。</p></fieldset>
            <section class="post-only body-composer" aria-labelledby="record-body-label"><div class="body-heading"><strong id="record-body-label">正文</strong><button id="insert-photo" type="button" disabled>＋ 在光标处插入照片</button></div><p class="muted small">点进文字段落，选好位置后插入照片；图片下方可以继续写下一段。</p><div class="composer-heading-tools" role="group" aria-label="正文小标题"><button type="button" data-heading-level="2">大标题</button><button type="button" data-heading-level="3">小标题</button><button type="button" data-heading-level="0">恢复正文</button><span class="muted small">光标放在文字行中选择层级，预览可查看字号与排版。</span></div><p id="heading-status" class="status small" role="status"></p><div id="body-editor"></div><textarea id="record-body" hidden></textarea></section>
            <section class="upload-area"><div><strong>照片与视频</strong><p id="media-note" class="muted small">照片按原图上传，不压缩，保留设备上的原件。照片和视频每个最多64 MB。</p></div><label id="choose-media" class="upload-button">＋ 选择照片或视频<input id="media-files" type="file" disabled multiple accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif,video/mp4,video/webm" /></label><p id="upload-status" role="status" class="status"></p><details id="media-panel" class="media-panel"><summary id="media-count">附件 · 0 张照片 · 展开管理</summary><p class="muted small">设置封面、调整附件顺序，或将已有照片再次插入正文。</p><div id="media-list" class="media-list"></div></details><div class="post-only row video-link"><input id="video-url" type="url" placeholder="也可以粘贴已有视频的 HTTPS 直链" /><button id="add-video" type="button">添加视频链接</button></div></section>
            <p id="local-save-status" class="status" role="status"></p><button id="export-local-record" type="button">导出当前内容到本机</button>
            <section id="record-conflict" class="conflict-panel" hidden><strong>线上已有不同版本，你的本机修改已保留</strong><p>下方是线上最新内容，当前编辑框保留本机内容。可以导出备份，或另存为新记录；不会强行覆盖线上版本。</p><label>线上最新内容（只读）<textarea id="latest-record" readonly rows="8"></textarea></label><div class="actions"><button id="reload-latest-record" type="button">重新读取线上版本</button><button id="copy-local-record" type="button">将本机内容另存为新记录</button></div></section>
            <div class="actions"><button id="save-draft" type="button">保存草稿</button><button id="publish" class="primary" type="submit">发布记录</button><button id="preview-toggle" type="button">预览</button></div>
            <p id="save-status" role="status" class="status"></p>
            <p class="muted small">草稿暂不显示在博客，但公开仓库仍可查看源文件。私密内容请留在本地。</p>
          </form>
          <section id="preview" hidden><h2 id="preview-title"></h2><div id="preview-body"></div><div id="preview-media" class="media-list"></div></section>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section id="friends-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>朋友的小站</h2><p class="muted small">网站简介介绍对方的内容；嘴哥备注可以留空，填写后会显示在友链页面和侧栏。</p><div id="friend-list"></div><div class="actions"><button id="add-friend">＋ 添加友链</button><button id="save-friends" class="primary">保存友链</button></div><p id="friends-status" role="status" class="status"></p></section>
      <section id="comments-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>最近的留言</h2><div id="admin-comment-list"></div><p id="comments-status" role="status" class="status"></p></section>
    </div>
  </main><div id="toc" hidden></div>
  <script>import "../scripts/editor";</script>
</body></html>
